{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"921a220806f68d66de57b27dd59223eb1b066e8d56be04c3105a8636a6e23e70","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1290},"chapter":{"number":59,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["先知指責百姓的罪惡"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"耶和華的膀臂並非縮短，不能拯救，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耳朵並非發沉，不能聽見，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但你們的罪孽使你們與上帝隔絕；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們的罪惡使他掩面不聽你們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因你們的手被血沾染，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們的指頭被罪孽沾污，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們的嘴唇說謊言，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們的舌頭出惡語。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"無一人按公義告狀，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"無一人憑誠實辯白；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都倚靠虛妄，說謊言。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所懷的是毒害；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所生的是罪孽。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們菢毒蛇蛋，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"結蜘蛛網；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人吃這蛋必死。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這蛋被踏，必出蝮蛇。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所結的網不能成為衣服；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所做的也不能遮蓋自己。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的行為都是罪孽；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"手所做的都是強暴。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的腳奔跑行惡；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們急速流無辜人的血；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"意念都是罪孽，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所經過的路都荒涼毀滅。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"平安的路，他們不知道；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所行的事沒有公平。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們為自己修彎曲的路；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"凡行此路的都不知道平安。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["百姓悔罪"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"因此，公平離我們遠，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"公義追不上我們。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們指望光亮，卻是黑暗，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"指望光明，卻行幽暗。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們摸索牆壁，好像瞎子；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們摸索，如同無目之人。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們晌午絆腳，如在黃昏一樣；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們在肥壯人中，像死人一般。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們咆哮如熊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"哀鳴如鴿；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"指望公平，卻是沒有；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"指望救恩，卻遠離我們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們的過犯在你面前增多，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"罪惡作見證告我們；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"過犯與我們同在。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"至於我們的罪孽，我們都知道：","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是悖逆、不認識耶和華，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"轉去不跟從我們的上帝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"說欺壓和叛逆的話，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"心懷謊言，隨即說出。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"並且公平轉而退後，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"公義站在遠處；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誠實在街上仆倒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"正直也不得進入。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誠實少見；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"離惡的人反成掠物。","poem":1},"耶和華準備拯救他的子民",{"text":"那時，耶和華看見沒有公平，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"甚不喜悅。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他見無人拯救，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"無人代求，甚為詫異，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就用自己的膀臂施行拯救，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以公義扶持自己。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他以公義為鎧甲","poem":1},{"noteId":70},{"text":"，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以拯救為頭盔，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以報仇為衣服，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以熱心為外袍。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他必按人的行為施報，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"惱怒他的敵人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"報復他的仇敵，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向眾海島施行報應。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["如此，人從日落之處必敬畏耶和華的名，",{"text":"從日出之地也必敬畏他的榮耀；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為仇敵好像急流的河水沖來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是耶和華之氣所驅逐的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"text":"必有一位救贖主來到錫安－","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雅各族中轉離過犯的人那裏。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["耶和華說：「至於我與他們所立的約乃是這樣：我加給你的靈，傳給你的話，必不離你的口，也不離你後裔與你後裔之後裔的口，從今直到永遠；這是耶和華說的。」"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":70,"caller":"-","text":"或譯：護心鏡","reference":{"chapter":59,"verse":17}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/59.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/60.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/58.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":21}